- For module root rules see @#module-roots (Module roots).
- For entry runtime and non-activation see @#entry-runtime-and-fragments (Entry runtime and fragments).
- For package origins and backing see @../packages/#package-origins-and-backing (Package origins and backing).
- For the full facade contract see @https://github.com/nyejames/moth/blob/main/docs/build-system-design.md (Build system design).
